 you file  as a married couple then you actually  pay more in taxes than you would if you  filed a single so so this this graphic  has some basic interactive features you  know you can you can hover over it and  it'll tell you some information so if  you want to find out like you know I'm a  couple or a couple and you know one  person makes this much money the other  person makes it the so the amount of  money you can get some detailed  information about how much of a bonus or  penalty your pain in Texas and that's  something that you know that it adds a  lot to this graphic if you just if you  just see this graphic like this you know  a lot of that information is there but  it's a little bit harder to interpret  and it's it's it's it's harder to find  yourself on here like what these these  various incomes I like on this on the  x-axis here it's a total income and the  y-axis is the percentage split that's  earned by each partner okay so that's  one

